obex_put
========

Simple OBEX PUT program,used to transfer small file over
RFCOMM connection.

Usage
=====
     @program <BT-ADDRESS> <RFCOMM-CHANNEL> <filename>
     # No command line parameter checking,thus the bad
       order to arguments will cause undefined behavior.
     # No SDP integrated,need to get Push channel manually.
         sdptool browser <BT-ADDRESS>
       (TODO)

Addition
========     

Need to keep the file name suffix as the same as the file
format,because @obex_put use the suffix to determines file's
MIME type.

Environment
===========
    gcc 14.2
    glibc 2.41
    kernel 6.18.33
